00:13:13,545 --> 00:13:14,585
[SPEAKER_03]: He said, Mentor Hayes.

287
00:13:15,205 --> 00:13:22,187
[SPEAKER_03]: He said, no, we have a Dr. Hayes, we have a Dick Hayes, we have an Ellick Hayes, and we have a Jack Hayes here.

288
00:13:22,207 --> 00:13:24,187
[SPEAKER_03]: He said, there he is, standing on the corner right over there.

289
00:13:26,308 --> 00:13:31,509
[SPEAKER_03]: So Mr. Griffith always knew me as Mentor, see, and asked for Mentor, and he said Jack.

